abstract: "An open, cross-disciplinary public coordinate system for adult communication grounded in 53 empirical and foundational theoretical works across interpersonal communication, social-personality psychology, organizational behavior, psychometrics, and information visualization. Anchored on Effectiveness (Goal Attainment) x Appropriateness (Relational Maintenance), it defines 8 core directions x 40 role-scoped situations, a Dual-Ring Polar Rose visual model (demonstrating closed radar 1.99x axis-permutation distortion), and a Three-Layer Competence Iceberg with Dual-Track Subjective/Objective Calibration."
